{"about_the_game":"<h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>Hunt &amp; Display Legendary Beasts in Cryptid Keeper: A Creature Collecting Zoo Adventure.</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >A unique blend of <strong>creature collecting</strong>, <strong>zoo management</strong>, and exploration.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Restore a forgotten zoo, uncover and capture the mysterious creatures roaming beyond its gates.</p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>Key Features:</strong></h2><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Hunt, trap, and re-home</strong> a diverse collection of mysterious Cryptids. Master the art of <strong>creature capture</strong>!</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Restore and manage your zoo</strong>, transforming it into a haven for rare and wondrous creatures. Attract visitors and build a unique collection of Cryptid exhibits.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Craft items, farm food, and gather resources</strong> to keep your operation running.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Unleash your inner scientist with <strong>Cryptid breeding</strong>! <strong>Mix and match creatures</strong> in the <strong>Breeding Enclosure</strong> to incubate <strong>Hybrid Cryptid Eggs</strong> and hatch entirely new, extraordinary creature combinations.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3667060/extras/c04a71f00aeca7b9e193131f2b5fd547.poster.avif?t=1773579974\" width=1170 height=292 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3667060/extras/c04a71f00aeca7b9e193131f2b5fd547.webm?t=1773579974\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3667060/extras/c04a71f00aeca7b9e193131f2b5fd547.mp4?t=1773579974\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p></li></ul><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Cryptid Keeper</strong> offers a cozy and engaging experience, putting you in the shoes of a man and his cat who abandon their ordinary lives to restore a dilapidated zoo. This <strong>creature collecting game</strong> blends adventure, management, and exploration for a heartwarming and unique gameplay experience.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" style=\"text-align: center\"><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3667060/extras/d52c73f64ea2d71b5c8821e609859933.poster.avif?t=1773579974\" width=1170 height=292 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3667060/extras/d52c73f64ea2d71b5c8821e609859933.webm?t=1773579974\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3667060/extras/d52c73f64ea2d71b5c8821e609859933.mp4?t=1773579974\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Explore a vast world map to track down elusive Cryptids and strange Alien beings.</p></li></ul><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Utilize your radar scanner to ping Creature locations to your map.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Set &amp; Bait Traps.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Balance strategy and resource management to successfully capture creatures in their natural habitat.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Experience the challenge and excitement of <strong>Cryptid Hunting</strong>!</p></li></ul><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3667060/extras/01793a6dce01b62cedd5714ae3077aa2.poster.avif?t=1773579974\" width=800 height=320 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3667060/extras/01793a6dce01b62cedd5714ae3077aa2.webm?t=1773579974\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3667060/extras/01793a6dce01b62cedd5714ae3077aa2.mp4?t=1773579974\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Between hunting or foraging expeditions, return to your zoo to manage your growing menagerie.</p><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Care for your Cryptids</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Feed them, water them, maintain their enclosures.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Attract curious visitors as your collection expands.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Build the ultimate <strong>cryptid zoo</strong> and share its wonders with the world.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Trade or sell unwanted creatures to further customize and shape your park to your liking!</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Breed Cryptids in the <strong>Breeding Enclosure</strong>, incubate <strong>Hybrid Cryptid Eggs</strong>, and hatch entirely new creature combinations.</p></li></ul><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3667060/extras/3e6878841ca2ba64b558512092305c40.poster.avif?t=1773579974\" width=800 height=260 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3667060/extras/3e6878841ca2ba64b558512092305c40.webm?t=1773579974\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3667060/extras/3e6878841ca2ba64b558512092305c40.mp4?t=1773579974\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" style=\"text-align: center\"><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3667060/extras/8085b6b9a5f22aac384bafc0f5c96852.webp?t=1773579974\" width=463 heig