ras/d52c73f64ea2d71b5c8821e609859933.mp4?t=1773579974\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Explore a vast world map to track down elusive Cryptids and strange Alien beings.</p></li></ul><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Utilize your radar scanner to ping Creature locations to your map.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Set &amp; Bait Traps.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Balance strategy and resource management to successfully capture creatures in their natural habitat.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Experience the challenge and excitement of <strong>Cryptid Hunting</strong>!</p></li></ul><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3667060/extras/01793a6dce01b62cedd5714ae3077aa2.poster.avif?t=1773579974\" width=800 height=320 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3667060/extras/01793a6dce01b62cedd5714ae3077aa2.webm?t=1773579974\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3667060/extras/01793a6dce01b62cedd5714ae3077aa2.mp4?t=1773579974\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Between hunting or foraging expeditions, return to your zoo to manage your growing menagerie.</p><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Care for your Cryptids</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Feed them, water them, maintain their enclosures.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Attract curious visitors as your collection expands.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Build the ultimate <strong>cryptid zoo</strong> and share its wonders with the world.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Trade or sell unwanted creatures to further customize and shape your park to your liking!</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_par